    "notes": [
      "Fees below EXCLUDE the 3.5% fuel and logistics surcharge (applied on top since 2026-04-17).",
      "Small standard uses UNIT weight only. Extra-large 150+ lb uses UNIT weight only.",
      "All other tiers use the GREATER of unit weight or dimensional weight.",
      "Dimensional weight = (longest x median x shortest) / 139, with a 2-inch minimum on median and shortest sides for bulky/extra-large tiers.",
      "Girth = 2 x (median side + shortest side). Length plus girth = longest side + girth.",
      "Non-apparel large standard above 3 lb: $0.08 per 4 oz interval. Apparel: $0.16 per half-lb interval.",
      "Dangerous goods use a separate rate card and are NOT included in this file."
    ]
  },

